  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"yAINf\" id=\"yAINf\"><span data-lake-id=\"uced88bfa\" id=\"uced88bfa\">重要步骤</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uac778482\" id=\"uac778482\"><span data-lake-id=\"u514d7a8f\" id=\"u514d7a8f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">在LVGL移植文档</span><a href=\"https://docs.lvgl.io/8.3/porting/project.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ubbba01cd\" id=\"ubbba01cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6dd9c998\" id=\"u6dd9c998\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">https://docs.lvgl.io/8.3/porting/project.html</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uff11b4c1\" id=\"uff11b4c1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">中， 总共有5个重要步骤：</span></p><ol list=\"u867af817\"><li fid=\"uedae7c91\" data-lake-id=\"u7254d4a4\" id=\"u7254d4a4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u80418dca\" id=\"u80418dca\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">调用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub9246b9e\" id=\"ub9246b9e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u26241b93\" id=\"u26241b93\">lv_init() </span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7f46a109\" id=\"u7f46a109\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">：lvgl的初始化核心</span></li><li fid=\"uedae7c91\" data-lake-id=\"u3b6e1d8d\" id=\"u3b6e1d8d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u298c1823\" id=\"u298c1823\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">初始化我们自己的屏幕驱动相关，I2C,SPI,ST7789,CST816T等</span></li><li fid=\"uedae7c91\" data-lake-id=\"uc31471a5\" id=\"uc31471a5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5817bc50\" id=\"u5817bc50\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">调用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8543a242\" id=\"u8543a242\"><span data-lake-id=\"u254a81fc\" id=\"u254a81fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">lv_port_disp_init()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud88e60aa\" id=\"ud88e60aa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">（负责显示部分） 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uddcd0156\" id=\"uddcd0156\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3e13ec52\" id=\"u3e13ec52\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">lv_port_indev_init()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3cd42560\" id=\"u3cd42560\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">（负责输入部分）</span></li><li fid=\"uedae7c91\" data-lake-id=\"uf0d5a0c5\" id=\"uf0d5a0c5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5da0cbdc\" id=\"u5da0cbdc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">调用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ud0e55c41\" id=\"ud0e55c41\"><span data-lake-id=\"u91cb8ff0\" id=\"u91cb8ff0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">lv_tick_inc(x)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubcc86118\" id=\"ubcc86118\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> ：这个是负责维持lvgl核心库的心跳</span></li><li fid=\"uedae7c91\" data-lake-id=\"u6ae04b54\" id=\"u6ae04b54\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ad4fe12\" id=\"u9ad4fe12\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">调用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u0e1b36e2\" id=\"u0e1b36e2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9d3a6b82\" id=\"u9d3a6b82\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">lv_timer_handler()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u43db4daf\" id=\"u43db4daf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">： 负责lvgl中的相关任务</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u4f7d784c\" id=\"u4f7d784c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufb60eec0\" id=\"ufb60eec0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3ce932a5\" id=\"u3ce932a5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3107095a\" id=\"u3107095a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">前面1，2，3个步骤都是与初始化相关，我们把它们写在启动任务中</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22static%20void%20start_task()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20taskENTER_CRITICAL()%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_init()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_port_disp_init()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_port_indev_init()%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20vTaskDelete(start_handler)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20taskEXIT_CRITICAL()%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uLBRc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u1fd0bcbd\" id=\"u1fd0bcbd\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"eZzXS\" id=\"eZzXS\"><span data-lake-id=\"u47357a4e\" id=\"u47357a4e\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ua754cafa\" id=\"ua754cafa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">lv_tick_inc(x) </span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u9a1908d1\" id=\"u9a1908d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf26a3afc\" id=\"uf26a3afc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">我们需要维持lvgl自身的心跳，以便让它能够处理它自身内部的任务，例如动画的渲染，长按单击事件的判断等等， 我们将这个函数放到FreeRTOS的调用函数中</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud027a285\" id=\"ud027a285\"><span data-lake-id=\"u93abd97a\" id=\"u93abd97a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">例如，我们在main.c文件中定义如下名称函数：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22main.c%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20vApplicationTickHook(%20void%20)%7B%5Cn%5Ctlv_tick_inc(1)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22main.c%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UD0t2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u79769a72\" id=\"u79769a72\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue3e7b81d\" id=\"ue3e7b81d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">注意，定义了这个函数，我们还需要打开它对应的宏，在</span><code data-lake-id=\"u51df414b\" id=\"u51df414b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ude5cb4b9\" id=\"ude5cb4b9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">FreeRTOSConfig.h</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4768795d\" id=\"u4768795d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">文件中第57行</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22FreeRTOSConfig.h%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23define%20configUSE_TICK_HOOK%5Ct1%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22FreeRTOSConfig.h%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vsnRa%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"m5pPE\" id=\"m5pPE\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1a9f6808\" id=\"u1a9f6808\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">lv_timer_handler()</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ud8e1cff5\" id=\"ud8e1cff5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc053939b\" id=\"uc053939b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">lvgl中的所有的任务处理都在这个函数里，lvgl是线程不安全的，这个函数同时只能有一个线程调用它，保险起见我们需要给它的调用加一把锁</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"Jz88m\" id=\"Jz88m\" data-lake-index-type=\"0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6560b1fb\" id=\"u6560b1fb\">声明一把锁</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22SemaphoreHandle_t%20%5CtxMutex%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22exceC%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"mCMpN\" id=\"mCMpN\" data-lake-index-type=\"0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u96fa3be0\" id=\"u96fa3be0\">初始化这把锁</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22xMutex%20%3D%20xSemaphoreCreateMutex()%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xaLde%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"HPXeY\" id=\"HPXeY\" data-lake-index-type=\"0\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf3a02514\" id=\"uf3a02514\">创建一个任务</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22xTaskCreate(lvgl_timer_task%2C%20%5C%22lvgl_timer_task%5C%22%2C%201024%2C%20NULL%2C%204%2C%20NULL)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TvmpM%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"PXJHD\" id=\"PXJHD\" data-lake-index-type=\"0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33dae01b\" id=\"u33dae01b\">编写任务的内容</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20lvgl_timer_task(void%20*%20pvParameters)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5CtxMutex%20%3D%20xSemaphoreCreateMutex()%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctlv_obj_t%20*%20btn2%20%3D%20lv_btn_create(lv_scr_act())%3B%5Cn%5Ctlv_obj_set_size(btn2%2C100%2C100)%3B%5Cn%5Ctlv_obj_align(btn2%2C%20LV_ALIGN_CENTER%2C%200%2C%200)%3B%5Cn%5Ctlv_obj_add_flag(btn2%2C%20LV_OBJ_FLAG_CHECKABLE)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct